"text": "The fall is 1.25 ft over 250 ft at 0.5% (about 15 inches).\n\n- Percent grade is the same number as feet of fall per 100 ft, so 0.5% is 0.5 ft per 100 ft [4].\n- As a decimal that is 0.0050 ft per ft, times 250 ft = 1.25 ft [5].\n- If the start invert is 352.40, the end invert is 351.15 (352.40 minus 1.25).",
